    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EB837EC0B45CBB4B",
      "text": "嗨，來留學的交換學生！\\n我是學生指導的老師！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EB837FC0B45CBCFE",
      "text": "我就開門見山地問了，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有在寶可夢對戰嗎！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EB8380C0B45CBEB1",
      "text": "我們藍莓學園為了提升\\n學生之間寶可夢對戰的熱忱，\\c\\n只要是在巨蛋裡和其他學生對戰，\\n學園就會贈送ＢＰ！\\r\\n而且是對戰得越多，送得就越多喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04a",
      "hash64": "8D357F72799A487F",
      "text": "首先，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就試著在草原區這裡\\n打贏[VAR 0x0201(0002)]個學生吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
