    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EB8700C0B45FCE08",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳值得收下這份\\n無敵霹靂努力獎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EB8707C0B45FD9ED",
      "text": "然後我還要再另外送給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n無敵霹靂棒的獎品！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EB8706C0B45FD83A",
      "text": "其他的區域也會有老師在，\\n所以[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去到那些地方也要加油喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EB8705C0B45FD687",
      "text": "所有區域的學生全都被[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳打敗了，\\n因此老師我要頒給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\r\\n巨蛋最佳學生獎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
